  "resolved_issues": [
    "PC sender left post-EOT C unread and did not wait for final trailer ACK; wrapper completes handshake without premature retry.",
    "HWCDC could stall a whole or partial JSON reply; public Serial wait/flush and read-only hello on stalled control requests recover TX without replaying commands."
  ],
  "limitations": [
    "Validated on this ESP32-C3 and Windows native USB setup only.",
    "Fast upload pauses UI/network polling; full transfer is retried after interruption, not resumed.",
    "Fast size limit INT32_MAX; larger files use legacy 32-bit-size upload.",
    "SD short/full-sink writes and USB TX failure injected in the actual C host receiver; real card was not filled or removed.",
    "Cancellation and receive timeout tested; no physical unplug, power-loss, or TF-media endurance test.",
    "YMODEM double-EOT incurs about 1 second from pinned PC library retry behavior.",
    "Existing complete Flash backup is Pixel 3.0.12; original factory backup is unavailable."
